#: src/menus/file/show-in-file-manager.xml:6(title)
#: src/menus/file/show-in-file-manager.xml:8(primary)
msgid "Show in File Manager"
msgstr "Mostrar no gerenciador de arquivos"

#: src/menus/file/show-in-file-manager.xml:11(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Show in File "
#| "Manager</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Show in File "
"Manager</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando na barra de menus da imagem em "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arquivo</guimenu><guisubmenu>Mostrar no gerenciador de "
"arquivos</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/file/show-in-file-manager.xml:19(para)
msgid ""
"This command opens the file manager in the directory containing the active "
"image"
msgstr ""
"Este comando abre o gerenciador de arquivos na pasta que contém a imagem "
"ativa"

#: src/menus/file/send-by-email.xml:6(title)
#: src/menus/file/send-by-email.xml:8(primary)
msgid "Send by Email"
msgstr "Enviar por e-mail"

#: src/menus/file/send-by-email.xml:11(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Send by "
#| "Email…</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Send by "
"Email…</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Você pode acessar este comando na barra de menus da imagem em "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arquivo</guimenu><guisubmenu>Enviar por "
"e-mail…</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/file/send-by-email.xml:19(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "This command opens a small dialog with the name of the image to be sent (you"
#| " can edit it). Clicking on the <guibutton>Send</guibutton> button opens your"
#| " default mail software with the image attached."
msgid ""
"This command opens a dialog with the name of the image to be sent via email "
"(you can edit it). Clicking on the <guibutton>Send</guibutton> button opens "
"your local default mail software with the image attached."
msgstr ""
"Este comando abre uma pequena caixa de diálogo com o nome da imagem a ser "
"enviada (você pode editá-lo). Clicar no botão <guibutton>Enviar</guibutton> "
"abre seu programa de e-mail padrão com a imagem anexada."

#: src/menus/file/send-by-email.xml:26(para)
msgid ""
"This command is only available on Unix/Linux-like operating systems with the"
" <link linkend=\"glossary-xdg\">xdg-utils</link> package installed, or if "
"your <acronym>GIMP</acronym> version was explicitly created (compiled) with "
"Sendmail support."
msgstr ""
"Este comando só está disponível em sistemas operacionais do tipo Unix/Linux "
"com o pacote <link linkend=\"glossary-xdg\">xdg-utils</link> instalado, ou "
"se sua versão do <acronym>GIMP</acronym> foi explicitamente criada "
"(compilada) com suporte a Sendmail."

