"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"ou usando o atalho de teclado "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>W</keycap></keycombo>."

#: src/menus/file/close.xml:60(para)
msgid ""
"In single-window mode, you can also execute it by clicking the "
"<quote>Close</quote> button on the image bar. In multi-window mode, you "
